Subject: [PATCH 2/2] attn: add focused Laguna kernel presets

Signed-off-by: Codex Agent <codex-agent@users.noreply.github.com>
---
 KERNEL_CONFIGURATION.md                                | 2 ++
 csrc/xpu/attn/kernel_configs/chunk_prefill_laguna.conf | 6 ++++++
 csrc/xpu/attn/kernel_configs/paged_decode_laguna.conf  | 7 +++++++
 3 files changed, 15 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 csrc/xpu/attn/kernel_configs/chunk_prefill_laguna.conf
 create mode 100644 csrc/xpu/attn/kernel_configs/paged_decode_laguna.conf

diff --git a/KERNEL_CONFIGURATION.md b/KERNEL_CONFIGURATION.md
index 9dedc39..d4a93ee 100644
--- a/KERNEL_CONFIGURATION.md
+++ b/KERNEL_CONFIGURATION.md
@@ -86,6 +86,7 @@ Config files are located in `csrc/xpu/attn/kernel_configs/`.
 |------|---------|----------|
 | `chunk_prefill_full.conf` | 216 | All combinations — supports every model |
 | `chunk_prefill_default.conf` | ~13 | Llama, Qwen, DeepSeek MLA, Falcon (default build) |
+| `chunk_prefill_laguna.conf` | 4 | Laguna S 2.1 target and DFlash only |
 
 ### Paged Decode
 
@@ -93,6 +94,7 @@ Config files are located in `csrc/xpu/attn/kernel_configs/`.
 |------|---------|----------|
 | `paged_decode_full.conf` | 384 | All combinations — supports every model |
 | `paged_decode_default.conf` | ~19 | Llama, Qwen, Laguna, DeepSeek MLA, Falcon (default build) |
+| `paged_decode_laguna.conf` | 4 | Laguna S 2.1 target and DFlash, page sizes 32/64 |
 
 ### Recommended Config per Model Family
 
diff --git a/csrc/xpu/attn/kernel_configs/chunk_prefill_laguna.conf b/csrc/xpu/attn/kernel_configs/chunk_prefill_laguna.conf
new file mode 100644
index 0000000..6e389f8
--- /dev/null
+++ b/csrc/xpu/attn/kernel_configs/chunk_prefill_laguna.conf
@@ -0,0 +1,6 @@
+# Laguna S 2.1 target and DFlash prompt-processing policies.
+# Format: headsize,paged,causal,local,sink,lse
+128,true,true,false,false,false
+128,false,true,false,false,false
+128,false,true,false,false,true
+128,true,false,true,false,false
diff --git a/csrc/xpu/attn/kernel_configs/paged_decode_laguna.conf b/csrc/xpu/attn/kernel_configs/paged_decode_laguna.conf
new file mode 100644
index 0000000..3bff0e3
--- /dev/null
+++ b/csrc/xpu/attn/kernel_configs/paged_decode_laguna.conf
@@ -0,0 +1,7 @@
+# Laguna S 2.1 target sliding attention and DFlash non-causal attention.
+# TP4 uses 18 Q / 2 KV heads per rank, selecting the qgroup=16 bucket.
+# Format: qgroup,headsize,pagesize,causal,local,sink
+16,128,32,false,true,false
+16,128,32,false,false,false
+16,128,64,false,true,false
+16,128,64,false,false,false
